        "subhead": null,
        "body": "<p>Everything a new garden needs in its first season, from a <strong>soil test</strong> to a watering rota.</p>\n<p><span data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://cms.example.com/apply/&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Apply for a garden&quot;,&quot;newTab&quot;:false,&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;primary&quot;}}\"></span> <span data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://example.org/starter-checklist.pdf&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Download the checklist&quot;,&quot;newTab&quot;:true,&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;secondary&quot;}}\"></span></p>\n<div data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;embed&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;A three-minute tour of a first-season garden.&quot;}\"></div>\n",
