            "eyebrow": null,
            "heading": "Test the soil first",
            "body": "<p>Before anything goes in the ground, send a soil sample to the county extension office. City lots often hold lead from old paint and fuel.</p>\n<div data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;pullquote&quot;,&quot;quote&quot;:&quot;Test first, plant second. Raised beds fix almost anything the test finds.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Rosa Delgado, garden lead&quot;}\"></div>\n<div data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;media&quot;:{&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://cms.example.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/raised-beds.jpg&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Raised garden beds in a city lot&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1600,&quot;height&quot;:1067},&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Raised beds on a former parking lot&quot;}}\"></div>\n<p>Once the beds are built, set a watering rota before the first hot week. <span data-launch-block=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://cms.example.com/get-involved/&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Find a mentor&quot;,&quot;newTab&quot;:false,&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}}\"></span></p>\n",
